'''Delano Johnson''' (born January 13, 1988) is an American former professional [[Canadian football|football]] [[defensive end]]. He played [[college football]] at [[Bowie State University]]. He was a member of the [[Houston Texans]], [[Toronto Argonauts]], [[Portland Steel|Portland Thunder/Steel]] and [[Hamilton Tiger-Cats]].
